#: apps/pwm/main/pw_sheets.c:740
La pata da 3,3 V y pocos mA: el LED con su resistencia (220 a 470 Ω) a GND. En modo LED, el brillo va con la curva de gamma.	The pin gives 3.3 V and a few mA: the LED with its resistor (220 to 470 Ω) to GND. In LED mode the brightness follows the gamma curve.

#: apps/pwm/main/pw_sheets.c:741
El LED prende cuando la pata va a 0: activá Invertir en los ajustes del canal.	The LED lights when the pin goes to 0: turn on Invert in the channel's settings.

#: apps/pwm/main/pw_sheets.c:742
El servo se alimenta aparte, con 5 V externos y no de la placa: GND en común con el header y sólo la señal a la pata. Modo Servo: 50 Hz y un pulso de 500 a 2500 µs.	The servo is powered separately, from an external 5 V and not from the board: GND shared with the header and only the signal to the pin. Servo mode: 50 Hz and a pulse from 500 to 2500 µs.

#: apps/pwm/main/pw_sheets.c:743
Un LED infrarrojo pide más corriente que la pata: un transistor NPN con 1 kΩ en la base. Para la portadora de un control remoto, PWM a 38 kHz con ciclo del 33 %.	An infrared LED wants more current than the pin gives: an NPN transistor with 1 kΩ on the base. For a remote control's carrier, PWM at 38 kHz with a 33 % duty.

#: apps/pwm/main/pw_sheets.c:744
El nivel analógico es un tren de pulsos a 1 MHz: 1 kΩ en serie y 1 µF a GND lo vuelven una tensión de 0 a 3,3 V, con pocos mV de ripple y ~5 ms para asentarse. Sin carga pesada a la salida.	The analog level is a pulse train at 1 MHz: 1 kΩ in series and 1 µF to GND turn it into 0 to 3.3 V, with a few mV of ripple and ~5 ms to settle. No heavy load on the output.

